The pets should be made more talkative.
This is somewhat of a fantasy game so talking pets wouldn't be out of
line.  It must be strange to these pets being as what these
players keep on coming into the duneg  dungeons and getting themselves
killed.  Maybe a bit of psycia  psychiatric dialog could happen from the 
pets to the players especially as the bones file gets longer.  Probably some
of that dialog would come out in the fashion of a drill instructor provided
the dialog was kept printable.  This would almost require naming your
pet as the game starts up and require a file with all previous pet names
be kept in it to prevent using old names.
Pets come back as ghosts too having their original
names so having your living pet with one name and all
ghost pets with different names would make it easy to distinguish 
which is which when you reach the bones levels.
